title: EvelynVentressClue0
---
During a late night spent studying in her dorm room, Evelyn noticed a hole in her wall. Tucked up high where the wall met the ceiling, the hole looked unnaturally circular. She climbed up on her chair, pressed herself against the wall, and peered inside at what looked like a tangle of wires. Tearing at the dry wall to make room, she pulled the wires out and found a glossy object attached at the end, shuddering when she spotted the interior lens. After reporting the camera to the RA, the university launched an investigation, but they never found the human behind the lens that had watched her for months. The feeling of eyes on her never left, even after the requested room change. 
===
title: EvelynVentressClue1
---
Evelyn volunteered at a local hospital in high school in hopes of bolstering her college applications. The patients were sweet to her and always made light-hearted conversation when she came by for visits. One late night, Evelyn was delivering fruit cups to a few long-term patients when she heard a crash from one of the rooms. With no nurses around, she ran into the room but saw nothing. Slowly, she eased past the foot of the empty hospital bed, and that’s when she saw the unnatural body on the floor. With arms bent backward and skin sagging off wasted bones, she gaped at the heap of what was once a young woman, just like her. She pressed an alarm for a nurse, who shooed her out of the room before rushing to the heap of bones on the floor. The image of the mangled figure still haunts her. 
===
title: EvelynVentressClue2
---
When she was 9, Evelyn dug through a box of her mother’s old clothes in the attic. She clutched an old prom dress closer to her chest, waltzing it around the room as she imagined herself a queen in a gilded ballroom. The fantasy faded back into reality when her father’s voice cut through the daydream with a command to come down for dinner. She quickly threw the dress back into the box and rushed downstairs. Her father met her at the bottom of the stairs and ordered her to stop. In an instant, his hand shot out and slapped her hard on the arm. She shrieked at the sudden attack, looking down at her stinging arm where she saw the smashed remains of a large spider that had been silently inching toward her face. 
===